Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.69,0:00:05.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}kid in Rosario,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.56,0:00:06.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}Argentina.
