Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.17,0:00:15.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}According to one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.67,0:00:15.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}of the men
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:16.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}who brought
