Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:25.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}at a tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.22,0:00:25.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}club with two
