Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:29.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}"regardless
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.85,0:00:30.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,960)\blur0.5}of any dissenting
